<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>
Live Classroom - <%= course.title %>
</title>

<link rel="stylesheet"
      href="/css/style.css">

</head>

<body>

<header>

<nav class="navbar">

<div class="logo">
Math<span>Master</span>
</div>

<div class="nav-links">

<a href="/student/dashboard">
Dashboard
</a>

<a href="/student/my-courses">
My Courses
</a>

<a href="/logout">
Logout
</a>

</div>

</nav>

</header>


<main class="dashboard">

<div class="dashboard-header">

<p class="eyebrow">
LIVE CLASSROOM
</p>

<h1>
<%= course.title %>
</h1>

<p>
Grade:
<strong><%= course.grade %></strong>
</p>

</div>


<div
    class="dashboard-card"
    style="border-left: 5px solid #2e7d32;"
>

<h2>
🟢 Live Classroom Active
</h2>

<p>
You have successfully joined the live classroom.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Started:</strong>
<%= activeSession.started_at %>
</p>

<p>
Your teacher is currently conducting this classroom session.
</p>

</div>

<div
    class="dashboard-card"
    style="margin-top: 20px;"
>

<h2>
How are you following the lesson?
</h2>

<p>
Let your teacher know how you are doing.
</p>


<div
    style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;"
>


<form
    method="POST"
    action="/student/courses/<%= course.id %>/classroom/interaction"
>

<input
    type="hidden"
    name="interactionType"
    value="understand"
>

<button
    class="btn primary"
    type="submit"
>
👍 Understand
</button>

</form>


<form
    method="POST"
    action="/student/courses/<%= course.id %>/classroom/interaction"
>

<input
    type="hidden"
    name="interactionType"
    value="not_sure"
>

<button
    class="btn secondary"
    type="submit"
>
🤔 Not Sure
</button>

</form>


<form
    method="POST"
    action="/student/courses/<%= course.id %>/classroom/interaction"
>

<input
    type="hidden"
    name="interactionType"
    value="need_help"
>

<button
    class="btn secondary"
    type="submit"
>
🆘 Need Help
</button>

</form>


<form
    method="POST"
    action="/student/courses/<%= course.id %>/classroom/interaction"
>

<input
    type="hidden"
    name="interactionType"
    value="repeat"
>

<button
    class="btn secondary"
    type="submit"
>
🔁 Repeat
</button>

</form>

<form
    method="POST"
    action="/student/courses/<%= course.id %>/classroom/interaction"
>

<input
    type="hidden"
    name="interactionType"
    value="raise_hand"
>

<button
    class="btn secondary"
    type="submit"
>
✋ Raise Hand
</button>

</form>


</div>

</div>

<div
    class="dashboard-card"
    style="margin-top: 20px;"
>

<h2>
💬 Message Your Teacher
</h2>

<p>
Have a question or something you would like your teacher to know?
</p>

<form
    method="POST"
    action="/student/courses/<%= course.id %>/classroom/message"
>

<textarea
    name="message"
    rows="4"
    placeholder="Type your question or message here..."
    style="width: 100%; max-width: 700px; padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;"
></textarea>

<br><br>

<button
    class="btn primary"
    type="submit"
>
Send Message
</button>

</form>

</div>

<div
    style="margin-top: 20px;"
>

<a
    href="/student/courses/<%= course.id %>/lessons"
    class="btn secondary"
>
← Back to Course Lessons
</a>

</div>

</main>

</body>

</html>
